{"4040750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paradoxical", "steam_appid": 4040750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move Portals </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals are physical objects. Carry and reposition them to create impossible connections through space and discover new solutions to every puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change Scale </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate portals of different sizes to alter the scale of objects, the environment, and even yourself. A small change in size can completely transform how you approach a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Eko </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eko is more than a companion. Use Eko to activate mechanisms, open portals, and solve puzzles that would be impossible alone. Mastering Eko's abilities is key to progressing through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/34f7f511b4837de7c907315976c8c272.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/34f7f511b4837de7c907315976c8c272.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/34f7f511b4837de7c907315976c8c272.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Uncover the Mystery </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desert civilization once looked to portal technology as its last hope. Explore the remnants of their world, travel between dimensions, and uncover what became of those who sought to save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/8237e140abcae297dbfa23153d542ad0.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/8237e140abcae297dbfa23153d542ad0.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/8237e140abcae297dbfa23153d542ad0.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move Portals </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals are physical objects. Carry and reposition them to create impossible connections through space and discover new solutions to every puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/39fabfa056fbe3816f9fc284fc5ede4a.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change Scale </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate portals of different sizes to alter the scale of objects, the environment, and even yourself. A small change in size can completely transform how you approach a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.poster.avif?t=1788292456\" width=474 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.webm?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/a0da740f63a50f1a152ea4e5f6606c23.mp4?t=1788292456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Eko </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eko is more than a companion. Use Eko to activate mechanisms, open portals, and solve puzzles that would be impossible alone. Mastering Eko's abilities is key to progressing through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/